# Malody V BepInEx bridge: build/download artefacts that must never be committed.
# The plugin DLL is shipped from plugin/MMAMalodySelection.dll (staged by build.ps1), so
# bin/ and obj/ stay out; tests/ is local-only per CLAUDE.md.
# Both .tools levels are covered because NuGet's globalPackagesFolder and the csproj's
# default BepInExDir resolve to different levels depending on which folder builds.
bridges/malody/bepinex/.tools/
bridges/malody/.tools/
bridges/malody/bepinex/plugin/bin/
bridges/malody/bepinex/plugin/obj/
bridges/malody/bepinex/plugin/tests/
/bridges/malody/bepinex/unity-libs
